{"items": [{"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/cong-cu-dung-cu/eaton-mtl-configuration-tools-and-software/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/zsyjufbk/pcl45usb.jpg?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fbbc9c63c02\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">MTL Instruments</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Eaton MTL Configuration Tools and Software</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">B&#x1ED9; c&#x1EA5;u h&#xEC;nh PCS45/PCL45USB: ph&#x1EA7;n m&#x1EC1;m v&#xE0; c&#xE1;p giao ti&#x1EBF;p &#x111;&#x1EA1;t ATEX &#x111;&#x1EC3; c&#x1EA5;u h&#xEC;nh b&#x1ED9; c&#xE1;ch ly MTL4000, MTL4500, MTL5000, MTL5500 t&#x1EEB; PC, k&#x1EC3; c&#x1EA3; khi &#x111;ang ch&#x1EA1;y.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["mtl-instruments"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/cong-cu-dung-cu/emerson-ams-trex-device-communicator/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/iilf3tyv/trex.jpg?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fbbcba35388\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Emerson</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">Emerson AMS Trex Device Communicator</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">Emerson AMS Trex: thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; c&#x1EA7;m tay c&#x1EA5;u h&#xEC;nh, ch&#x1EA9;n &#x111;o&#xE1;n thi&#x1EBF;t b&#x1ECB; HART v&#xE0; FOUNDATION fieldbus t&#x1EA1;i hi&#x1EC7;n tr&#x1B0;&#x1EDD;ng &#x2013; an to&#xE0;n n&#x1ED9;i t&#x1EA1;i, c&#x1EA5;p ngu&#x1ED3;n v&#xF2;ng, m&#xE0;n h&#xEC;nh c&#x1EA3;m &#x1EE9;ng.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["emerson"]}}, {"html": "<a class=\"v-card\" href=\"/san-pham/cong-cu-dung-cu/kim-tuot-bam-cot-weidmuller-stripax-plus/\">\n        <div class=\"v-card__media v-card__media--contain\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/vtl-site/media/a0xdus52/stripax-1.webp?width=600&amp;v=1dd5fc1725b2ea0\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n    <div class=\"v-card__body\">\n <span class=\"v-card__tag\">Weidm&#xFC;ller</span>         <h3 class=\"v-card__title\">K&#xEC;m tu&#x1ED1;t &#x2013; b&#x1EA5;m c&#x1ED1;t Weidm&#xFC;ller Stripax Plus</h3>\n <p class=\"v-card__text\">D&#x1EE5;ng c&#x1EE5; 3 trong 1: c&#x1EAF;t, tu&#x1ED1;t v&#x1ECF; v&#xE0; b&#x1EA5;m &#x111;&#x1EA7;u c&#x1ED1;t d&#x1EA1;ng d&#x1EA3;i &#x2013; t&#x103;ng t&#x1ED1;c &#x111;&#x1EA5;u d&#xE2;y t&#x1EE7; &#x111;i&#x1EC7;n.</p>         <span class=\"v-card__more\">Xem chi ti&#x1EBF;t →</span>\n    </div>\n</a>", "filters": {"hang": ["weidmueller"]}}], "size": 3}